": "subtitle", "time": 7601.99, "timestamp": "02:06:41", "text": "呃，我不知道……你想聊聊吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7605.43, "timestamp": "02:06:45", "text": "跟我说说你最喜欢的火警警报器吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7611.03, "timestamp": "02:06:51", "text": "抱歉，我没有看过Jasima的评论。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7613.669, "timestamp": "02:06:53", "text": "也可以公开聊天，如果有人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7614.95, "timestamp": "02:06:54", "text": "想问的是，你会问什么问题？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7618.31, "timestamp": "02:06:58", "text": "想被问到这个问题吗？是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7619.75, "timestamp": "02:06:59", "text": "请谁来问我这个问题。"}]